  faqs: { en: [
    { q: "Does Exit at Mkt & Cxl close all my positions or just one?", a: "Just the instrument loaded in that module. It flattens the position and cancels the working orders for that one contract. To close everything across every instrument at once, click your account balance at the top of the platform instead." },
